    "text": "4 hours ago RUSSELLVILLE, Ark. – On the eve of the Great American Conference Volleyball Championships, the league announced its 2025 All-Conference awards and end-of-year honors. East Central University represented well, with Faiana Halatoa, Emily Pena, and Valentina Tijerina each earning All-GAC Honorable Mention recognition. Nominations were submitted and voted on by... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
